td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/industry-company/2026/03/07/R4QPPDO55JAIVAVXUONC7XJUFU/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Minister of Industry and Director of the Trade Headquarters to Washington... 'Coupang Incident' Last-minute persuasion ahead of US investigation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/industry-company/2026/03/07/R4QPPDO55JAIVAVXUONC7XJUFU/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;산업장관·통상본부장 워싱턴行…‘쿠팡 사태’ 美 조사 앞두고 막판 설득&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/GYZGEMJYGJQTIYJXGBSTQOJRGI.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/industry-company/2026/03/07/S75PKXBXVVCA5P4RW2JM4LZJJE/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Direct hit by the slowdown in demand for electric vehicles... SK On lays off one-third of its US battery factory&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/industry-company/2026/03/07/S75PKXBXVVCA5P4RW2JM4LZJJE/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;전기차 수요 둔화 직격탄…SK온 美 배터리 공장 3분의 1 해고&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/MQ2DCYZXGYYTONLFGZRTKNRUHA.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/industry-company/2026/03/07/MYZWIMLBMI2WGY3FGM4TANDGGE/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Aftermath of the electric vehicle slump... SK On lays off one-third of its employees at its battery plant in Georgia, USA&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/industry-company/2026/03/07/MYZWIMLBMI2WGY3FGM4TANDGGE/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;전기차 부진 여파… SK온, 美 조지아 배터리 공장 직원 3분의1 해고&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/HE4TENBRHFTDSNZWG5QTCNZQG4.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/economy_general/2026/03/07/GZQTMM3GGE3TMNLCME2GCZBZGM/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Former President Moon Jae-in: "Trump's visit to China may be a momentum for peace on the Korean Peninsula"&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/economy_general/2026/03/07/GZQTMM3GGE3TMNLCME2GCZBZGM/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;문재인 전 대통령 “트럼프 방중, 한반도 평화 모멘텀 될수도”&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/HFTDANLEMMZTCNZQMNTGIYTCGU.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/economy_general/2026/03/07/G4ZTGNJZMM2DSYLCGU3DCOLCGE/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;President Lee said that 'Wang Sanam' exceeded 10 million, saying, "Achievement in two years... Congratulations and gratitude"&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/economy_general/2026/03/07/G4ZTGNJZMM2DSYLCGU3DCOLCGE/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;李 대통령, ‘왕사남’ 1000만 돌파에 “2년 만의 성과… 축하와 감사”&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/AN6HDQM7HBM5ZIJXCY73LKZYVU.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/industry-company/2026/03/07/MLYTXWN7Z5FWTBGCILTIW4GWDE/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;U.S. oil soared 12% in one day alone, breaking through $90... Crude oil supply dries up&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/industry-company/2026/03/07/MLYTXWN7Z5FWTBGCILTIW4GWDE/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;美유가 하루에만 12% 급등해 90달러 돌파…원유 공급이 말라간다&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/HEIF7WO355OCRC25UVXGRP5J3U.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/economy_general/2026/03/07/2AR7IW2WSRD5HJFTNDUTDRLBOY/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;The exchange rate, which was close to 1,500 won, closed in the early 1,480 won range due to the US employment shock&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/economy_general/2026/03/07/2AR7IW2WSRD5HJFTNDUTDRLBOY/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;1500원 육박했던 환율, 美 고용 쇼크에 1480원대 초반 마감&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/GNSWMMDEMMZWIZDBMFRTGZJWGQ.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/economy_general/2026/03/07/GJRTGNZTG4YGGZRVGJTDGYZVGA/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Leaving the country from Qatar and Jordan... Koreans in the Middle East evacuated one after another&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/economy_general/2026/03/07/GJRTGNZTG4YGGZRVGJTDGYZVGA/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;카타르·요르단에서도 출국… 중동지역 한국인 속속 대피&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/KVUPEMVYKSDL35IQSB7CZJ3YXI.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/science/2026/03/07/MFSTAM3CMM3TQMZUMJSDMZTGGI/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Debt of 50 billion won, complete capital erosion... Bukwang Pharmaceutical "Even if Union Pharmaceutical is delisted, it will be forced to acquire 30 billion won"&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/science/2026/03/07/MFSTAM3CMM3TQMZUMJSDMZTGGI/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;빚 500억·완전 자본잠식 덮쳤지만…부광약품 “유니온제약 상폐돼도 300억 인수 강행”&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/GE4DONBZGE4WCYJTMRSWIZRZMI.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/econo